#: scenario7:scenario7_F82E2626_05F1_49B0_B655_22D8351EAA85
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 8afd19b5fba8eb0002cfbd0644033fbe586a9994ec1a80b6351e1f9c0247a892
#. default-sha256: 8fd5a36bb2a2a24efe190bfdf801c176207a4a77425020ae44cb2b75959841a7
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_F82E2626_05F1_49B0_B655_22D8351EAA85"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The archangel stood proudly upon "
"his glass perch,⟪k:12⟫looking down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫L’archange se tenait fièrement sur "
"son perchoir de verre,⟪k:12⟫me contemplant de haut."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3685A8D2_76B9_410A_92EE_946FC39B311A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c8ab0ebae6abe49946b13b9d408bf94d36fa655f09017411080f20e05ac73c99
#. default-sha256: 965219b8e6a0f37d7b268d759c09e71ca61c25f81252d96a97816e34b6cf48d9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_3685A8D2_76B9_410A_92EE_946FC39B311A"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫His gaze almost seemed... ⟪k:1⟫judgmental."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Son regard me semblait presque... ⟪k:1⟫accusateur."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: d538275a8da61507cec5888aad107de4f2ce1972bb8c46bb0132f45e80017e07
#. default-sha256: 3ed7aeaa35183a9f5ba99a664992fef520dbb5e35db7fbbbb59db4a31487182e
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫But I marched for the tower, unconcerned."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais je poursuivis mon chemin vers la tour, indifférent."

#: scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 74eacc45a4b91de48ad7b725d959997a7eda1e35c9e959ee598e776ac633bf5c
#. default-sha256: 8fa92ad07e2f953c42b6c4ba46d3783eb13b666c456d478e3b8b07d11d6fd8f9
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For the day someone would truly set me free."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Le jour où quelqu’un viendrait me libérer."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: a91499462ed1933849c72d34b0ec790ae5a05f106f1047e21780aefa1bad5ce6
#. default-sha256: d87683f9c5dc14d1ea9a3dcc7b696e92b9ce74d1626d332723446c0bee4605b3
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That you were led here—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that you were ⟪k:3⟫meant⟪k:4⟫ to come to this place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫J’ai senti que tu avais été guidé jusqu’ici —⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ que tu étais ⟪k:3⟫destiné⟪k:4⟫ à "
"venir à cet endroit."

#: scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 9047c50fed0dc19e1910e272f3c19045097bd65446c40bbeff8a520d417eb56b
#. default-sha256: b5e14d4e39d72504bbcd0d4bce577852ff33de0d6d6bf81519a81bae378b1d18
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I know how it feels to be locked up...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to be tortured and used for others’ gain."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Je sais ce que ça fait d’être emprisonné...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫...d’être torturé, d’être utilisé, "
"abusé par les autres."

#: scenario7:scenario7_073CCD59_A5F1_4026_98A1_77E035B7B0DA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 3c7cbd172483bd283862d83f77361c41ffdb9764d7e04ed1f913bcf466d24f97
#. default-sha256: 0621105442db3488cc268d10430dc42497577414363e62ab9e487ddd8133bff2
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_073CCD59_A5F1_4026_98A1_77E035B7B0DA"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and I shall be the only one to have compassion for you."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...et je serai la seule à avoir de la compassion pour toi."

#: scenario7:scenario7_B32E596E_4255_43C7_A3F1_2A0BD187862D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 520f80264063aa94bde892f5113a6380c3388c2cd51a4abf566ed35a911d4e1f
#. default-sha256: 67590fab874c9c397cc1680c3e88b6175822c86c9ad0ab7033579e170413dfd4
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_B32E596E_4255_43C7_A3F1_2A0BD187862D"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫You were the only one to stay at my side..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Toi seul es resté à mes côtés..."

